<%# Gallery: work, dishes, the room. On phones a row to swipe (scroll snap, the next photo peeks
    in so people know to swipe); on wide screens a grid with one large photo. Use the owner's
    uploads first (Active Storage), then bin/images. The wide grid holds five: one large, four small. Replace each box with image_tag … class:
    "size-full object-cover", with real alt text. %>
<section class="bg-surface py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
    <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink md:text-4xl">Mẫu đã làm</h2>
      <a href="#" class="hidden items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-600 sm:inline-flex">Xem thêm <%= icon "arrow-right", size: 16 %></a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="mt-8 flex snap-x snap-mandatory scroll-px-4 gap-3 overflow-x-auto px-4 pb-2 [scrollbar-width:none] md:mx-auto md:grid md:max-w-6xl md:grid-cols-4 md:grid-rows-2 md:overflow-visible">
    <% 5.times do |i| %>
      <li class="w-[75%] shrink-0 snap-start overflow-hidden rounded-xl md:w-auto <%= "md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2" if i.zero? %>">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] size-full bg-gradient-to-br <%= i.even? ? "from-brand-100 to-brand-300" : "from-brand-300 to-brand-600" %> md:aspect-auto md:min-h-48"></div>
      </li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
</section>
